{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "46e01320-15cc-5c71-a343-15802a17af77",
    "name": "Leash",
    "description": "Leash dashboard API: the happy path (paid, held then approved, held then denied) and the attacks Leash must refuse (no token, wrong token, agent bearer token, cross-site Origin, form post, foreign Host, a hijacked $500 request, approving a blocked payment).\n\nPick the Local or Render environment and set its `dashboardToken`. The run sends 4 scripted requests; the policy allows 5 a minute, so wait a minute between runs. Spec: docs/openapi.yaml.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Happy path",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health check",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"status is 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test(\"says ok\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().ok).to.eql(true));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/healthz",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "healthz"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "State with the dashboard token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"status is 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const state = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test(\"has a policy and a decision list\", () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(state.policy.per_transaction_cap_usd).to.be.a(\"number\");",
                  "  pm.expect(state.decisions).to.be.an(\"array\");",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test(\"runs in a known mode\", () => pm.expect([\"dry-run\", \"sandbox\", \"live\"]).to.include(state.mode));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-Leash-Token",
                "value": "{{dashboardToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/state",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "state"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Simulate small: paid without a human",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"status is 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const record = pm.response.json().record;",
                  "pm.test(\"not blocked\", () => pm.expect(record.verdict).to.not.eql(\"block\"));",
                  "pm.test(\"paid without a human when no catalog is configured\", () => {",
                  "  if (record.catalog === null) {",
                  "    pm.expect(record.verdict).to.eql(\"allow\");",
                  "    pm.expect([\"paid\", \"submitted\"]).to.include(record.status);",
                  "  }",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Leash-Token",
                "value": "{{dashboardToken}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/simulate",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "simulate"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\"scenario\": \"small\"}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Simulate large: held for a human",
